   "subject": "",
   "body": "Amazing! I'd love to share a little more about what we're building. We have a short video that explains how CyberSafely uses AI to help parents recognize concerning online behavior while respecting their child's privacy:\nhttps://www.instagram.com/reel/Dc_f1R2C8pq/\n\nWe'd love to give you free access to try it with your family and see if it's something you'd feel comfortable sharing with your community. Want me to send over your access details?",
