   "name": "DM4 · Welcome: Parent Ambassador access + codes",
   "to": null,
   "subject": "",
   "body": "Hi {{greeting}}! We'd love to welcome you to the CyberSafely Parent Ambassador community! 💙\n\nHere's what we'd love to offer you:\n✨ Free CyberSafely access for your family, so you can explore the platform and see how it works firsthand.\n🔑 Your personal access code, so you can get started without paying: {{access_code}}\n🔗 Your referral code to share with followers who may be interested in protecting their children's digital wellbeing: {{code}}\n📱 Easy setup and support. We'll walk you through getting started and we're here if you have any questions.\n\nOur goal is to connect with parents who care about helping families navigate the digital world safely. We'd love for you to experience CyberSafely yourself and, if you genuinely find it valuable, share it with your community.\n\nReady to get started? You can sign up here: https://cybersafely.ai/login\n\nOnce you've signed up, let me know if you have any questions or need help getting your family set up. We're excited about the possibility of working together!\n\n{{sender}}, The CyberSafely Team",
